  "description": "Is the hand that heals the incurable a miracle, or a curse? Detective Lee Chang loses his family overnight in an accident. His only remaining family member is Chae-Rin, who inherited his sister's rare disease. Ten years ago, he visits the Cheonryong Church, the place that performed the miracle of healing his sister, but the cult leader, his last hope, is found dead.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes four side story chapters.*",
